  "pool": {
    "_comment": ["Ian, 2026-09-21: vanilla's three pre-League legendaries (Uxie, Azelf, the", "roaming Mesprit) already felt like a lot, and twenty new ones as statics is", "not feasible. So the two lake caverns and the roamer slot each draw at random", "from one pool: Uxie's cavern and Azelf's cavern become two static battles", "drawn without replacement from `candidates`, and Mesprit's roamer becomes a", "random roamer from the same list. A playthrough meets three of them before", "the League, as vanilla did; which three is the draw. The scripting is", "outside this track (decision 8). A candidate counts as sourced on paper;", "R12 in the linter reads the tree and will report these until the scripts", "exist. One list on purpose; split it into a static list and a roamer list", "in this file if some should never roam."],
    "statics": ["Uxie's cavern (Acuity Cavern)", "Azelf's cavern (Valor Cavern)"],
    "roamer": "Mesprit's roamer, released at Lake Verity",
    "candidates": ["SPECIES_UXIE", "SPECIES_AZELF", "SPECIES_MESPRIT", "SPECIES_GALARIAN_ARTICUNO", "SPECIES_GALARIAN_ZAPDOS", "SPECIES_GALARIAN_MOLTRES", "SPECIES_ZYGARDE_10", "SPECIES_DIANCIE", "SPECIES_TAPU_KOKO", "SPECIES_TAPU_LELE", "SPECIES_TAPU_BULU", "SPECIES_TAPU_FINI", "SPECIES_NIHILEGO", "SPECIES_BUZZWOLE", "SPECIES_PHEROMOSA", "SPECIES_XURKITREE", "SPECIES_CELESTEELA", "SPECIES_KARTANA", "SPECIES_GUZZLORD", "SPECIES_STAKATAKA", "SPECIES_BLACEPHALON", "SPECIES_POIPOLE", "SPECIES_MAGEARNA"]
  },
  "honey": {
    "_comment": ["The honey trees, designed from Step 5 on rather than only de-leaked: 21", "trees from Route 205 onward, three rarity tiers of six slots, today all", "off-list bar Combee and Heracross. The rare tier (Munchlax's six slots in", "vanilla) carries the three grass starters, reachable early and rare."],
